<p class="mb-4 whitespace-pre-wrap">3.3.4.5 Impersonating or claiming status of others for fraudulent purposes. For the avoidance of doubt, You may not impersonate any person or entity or falsely state or misrepresent your affiliation with a person or entity. It is prohibited to impersonate the Company, its employees, affiliates, or other related persons, including but not limited to the creators of surveys, lessons, or other content on the System or that contains the Services, to engage with the clients of the Company with a goal to provide any fake or harmful information.</p>
