<p class="mb-4 whitespace-pre-wrap">7.1.2 Right to Delete. You have the right to request that the Company delete any of Your Personal Information that we collected from You and retained, subject to certain exceptions (such as if the data is necessary to complete a transaction, detect security incidents, or comply with a legal obligation).</p>
