<p class="mb-4 whitespace-pre-wrap">8.3 To facilitate our global operations and provide the Services, the Company may transfer, store, and process Your Personal Information in jurisdictions other than Your country or state of residence. These jurisdictions may have data protection laws that differ from those in Your home territory.</p>
