<p class="mb-4 whitespace-pre-wrap">9.2 Internal Disclosure. Within the Company, access to Your Personal Information is restricted to those employees, departments, or contractors who require the information to fulfill our contractual and legal obligations. This includes teams responsible for account management, technical support, and the maintenance and improvement of the Services.</p>
